  "Mask of Mischief & Innocence Lv.$1": "",
  "Mask of Mischief & Innocence <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Ice damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $5 for $7 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Mischief & Innocence].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Combine the powers of Jack-o'-Lantern and Jack Frost to deal Fire and Ice damage to an enemy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Mask of Service & Admonition Lv.$1": "",
  "Mask of Service & Admonition <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Wind damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, decrease party's DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 more for $8 turns. \\nAlso, restore party's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of {{A}} & {{B}}'s ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color>. \\nGain [Facade of Service & Admonition].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Combine the powers of Agathion and Sudama to deal Electric and Wind damage to an enemy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense Lv.$1": "",
  "Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>).\\nAlso, increase Pierce for Justine & Caroline and the Sweeper/Assassin ally with the highest ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 more for $8 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Combine the powers of Mandrake and Onmoraki to deal Psychokinesis and Nuclear damage to an enemy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Mask of Luck & Loss Lv.$1": "",
  "Mask of Luck & Loss <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Bless damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Curse damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>).\\nAlso, increase Justine & Caroline's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 more; DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $9 more; and Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $12 more for $14 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Luck & Loss].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Combine the powers of Shiisaa and Bugs to deal Bless and Curse damage to an enemy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=26>Two Masks as One Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=26>Two Masks as One <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). Also, spend all [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facades</u></link>] to activate the following effects based on their combination.\\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence] + [Facade of Service & Admonition]: Restore party's HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Also, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 for $8 turns.\\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence] + [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Grant other allies <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of [<link\\=\"s|272\"><u>Skill Effect Amp</u></link>] for $12 turns. Also, increase other allies' Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $10. \\nSkill Effect Amp: Increase the values of {{C}} skills and Thief Tactics that are increased when leveled up. This effect is calculated separately from other effects.\\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence] + [Facade of Luck & Loss]: Change this skill's target to all foes.\\n[Facade of Service & Admonition] + [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Grant all allies a Shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> of Justine & Caroline's ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> and 1 Down Point for $17 turns. Also, increase party's DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$16</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $15.\\n[Facade of Service & Admonition] + [Facade of Luck & Loss]: $18 base chance to inflict Shock, Windswept and $19 Curse stacks on the main target, and gain $20 Blessing stacks. These effects last for $21 turns. Also, decrease all foes' DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$22</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$24</color> X Desire Level points / $23 for $25 turns.\\n[Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense] + [Facade of Luck & Loss]: This skill deals 1 more hit of Almighty damage. Also, gain [Rebel Surveillance] for $26 turns.\\n[Rebel Surveillance]: When using skills, temporarily gain <color\\=#FFFC40>$27</color> of <link\\=\"s|274\"><u>Effects Stats</u></link> from the Assassin/Sweeper ally with the highest ATK (excluding Justine & Caroline).\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>With the power of the Velvet Room's attendants, harness a variety of Facades to grant various effects.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: When activating a HIGHLIGHT, choose 1 of the 2 selected Persona sets and activate its HIGHLIGHT below (cooldown times for each HIGHLIGHT are calculated independently).\\n[Mask of Mischief & Innocence]: Increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> and DMG Bonus by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns.\\n[Mask of Service & Admonition]: Restore party's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of Justine & Caroline's ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Increase party's Max HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> for $7 turns.\\n[Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> of ATK, and Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of ATK (1 hit each). Increase ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> for Justine & Caroline and the ally with the highest ATK (prioritizing Assassins or Sweepers) for $11 turns.\\n[Mask of Luck & Loss]: Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$12</color> of ATK, and deal Curse damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> of ATK (1 hit each). Increase Justine & Caroline's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> and Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$15</color> for $16 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Almighty damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: When activating a HIGHLIGHT, choose 1 of the 2 selected Persona sets and activate its HIGHLIGHT below (cooldown times for each HIGHLIGHT are calculated independently).\\n[Mask of Mischief & Innocence]: Increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> and DMG Bonus by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns.\\n[Mask of Service & Admonition]: Restore party's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of Justine & Caroline's ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Increase party's Max HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> for $7 turns.\\n[Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> of ATK, and Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of ATK (1 hit each, this damage can deal critical hits). Increase ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> for Justine & Caroline and the ally with the highest ATK (prioritizing Assassins or Sweepers) for $11 turns.\\n[Mask of Luck & Loss]: Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$12</color> of ATK, and deal Curse damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> of ATK (1 hit each, this damage can deal critical hits). Increase Justine & Caroline's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> and Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$15</color> for $16 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Almighty damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] based on Justine & Caroline's stats.\\nFor every $1 points of ATK, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $2 (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>).\\nFor every $4 of DMG Bonus, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $5 (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>).\\nFor every $7 of Crit DMG above $8, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $9 (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color>).": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] based on Justine & Caroline's stats.\\nFor every $1 points of ATK, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $2 (up to <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color>).\\nFor every $4 of DMG Bonus, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $5 (up to <color\\=#0169ca>$6</color>).\\nFor every $7 of Crit DMG above $8, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $9 (up to <color\\=#0169ca>$10</color>).": "",
  "Gain stats bonuses based on the selected {{A}} combinations: [Mask of Mischief & Innocence] + [Mask of Service & Admonition]: Increase Healing Effect by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. Also, when on the field, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>.\\n[Mask of Mischief & Innocence] + [Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Increase SPD by $3. Also, when on the field, increase party's ATK <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>.\\n[Mask of Mischief & Innocence] + [Mask of Luck & Loss]: Increase Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>.\\n[Mask of Service & Admonition] + [Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Increase Shield Effect by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>.\\n[Mask of Service & Admonition] + [Mask of Luck & Loss]: Increase SPD by $7. Also, when on the field, increase all foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color>.\\n[Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense] + [Mask of Luck & Loss]: Increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color>.": "",
  "Gain stats bonuses based on the selected {{A}} combinations: [Mask of Mischief & Innocence] + [Mask of Service & Admonition]: Increase Healing Effect by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. Also, when on the field, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>.\\n[Mask of Mischief & Innocence] + [Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Increase SPD by $3. Also, when on the field, increase party's ATK <color\\=#0169ca>$4</color>.\\n[Mask of Mischief & Innocence] + [Mask of Luck & Loss]: Increase Crit Rate by <color\\=#0169ca>$5</color>.\\n[Mask of Service & Admonition] + [Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Increase Shield Effect by <color\\=#0169ca>$6</color>.\\n[Mask of Service & Admonition] + [Mask of Luck & Loss]: Increase SPD by $7. Also, when on the field, increase all foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#0169ca>$8</color>.\\n[Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense] + [Mask of Luck & Loss]: Increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$9</color>.": "",
  "Increase [Desire Level] by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> points.": "",
  "Increase [Desire Level] by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> points.": "",
  "When {{A}} & {{B}} are on the field, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. Gain bonus effects based on their role.\\nMedic: Increase party's Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>. At the end of turn, restore <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> HP. \\nStrategist: Increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>.\\nSweeper: Increase Justine & Caroline's Persona <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>.\\nGuardian: Increase party's Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>. At the start of Justine & Caroline's turn, grant the party a Shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns.\\nSaboteur: Increase all foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color>.\\nAssassin: Increase Justine & Caroline's Persona <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color>.": "",
  "When {{A}} & {{B}} are on the field, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. Gain bonus effects based on their role.\\nMedic: Increase party's Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>. At the end of turn, restore <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color> HP. \\nStrategist: Increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$4</color>.\\nSweeper: Increase Justine & Caroline's Persona <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by <color\\=#0169ca>$5</color>.\\nGuardian: Increase party's Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$6</color>. At the start of Justine & Caroline's turn, grant the party a Shield equal to <color\\=#0169ca>$7</color> for $8 turns.\\nSaboteur: Increase all foes' DMG Taken by <color\\=#0169ca>$9</color>.\\nAssassin: Increase Justine & Caroline's Persona <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by <color\\=#0169ca>$10</color>.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Desire Level</color>": "",
  "Influences the effects of certain skills based on stacks.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Skill Effect Amp</color>": "",
  "Increase the effects of skills/Thief Tactics that are increased when levelling up skills. This effect is calculated independently of other effects. For effects that influences the Phantom Thieves' stats, the stats increase cap will not be raised, but instead be applied directly as a skill effect.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Facade</color>": "",
  "The effects of [Two Masks as One] change depending on the combination of Facades gained.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Effects Stats</color>": "",
  "Effect stats include Crit Rate, Crit DMG, Pierce, DMG Bonus, Weak DMG, and more.": "",
  "Twin Wardens": "",
  "After obtaining Justine & Caroline, during battle, increase Wonder's skill and Thief Tactics levels by 1 (takes effect even when Justine & Caroline are not in battle).\\nBefore entering battle, Justine & Caroline can select 2 of their $1 sets of Personas, and their Skill 1 and Skill 2 will change accordingly. During battle, Justine & Caroline will receive the following role effect based on the selected sets:\\nMask of Mischief & Innocence + Mask of Service & Admonition: Medic\\nMask of Mischief & Innocence + Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense: Strategist\\nMask of Mischief & Innocence + Mask of Luck & Loss: Sweeper\\nMask of Service & Admonition + Mask of Absurdity & Nonsense: Guardian\\nMask of Service & Admonition + Mask of Luck & Loss: Saboteur\\nMask of Absurdity & Nonsense + Mask of Luck & Loss: Assassin\\nSkill effects are affected by [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>]. At the start of battle, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $2.": "",
  "Strict Tolerance": "",
  "At the start of battle, depending on the selected Personas, gain 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>].\\nAt the start or end of Justine & Caroline's turn, if they have 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>], automatically activate [Two Masks as One] on a random target 1 time, prioritizing the target of the previous skill attack used.": "",
  "Callous Kindness": "",
  "When a [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] is gained, gain the following buff based on the type of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>]. \\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence]: Increase party's ATK by $1 for $2 turns.\\n[Facade of Service & Admonition]: Decrease party's DMG Taken by $3 for $4 turns.\\n[Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Increase Crit DMG of the Assassin/Sweeper ally with the highest ATK by $5 for $6 turns.\\n[Facade of Luck & Loss]: Increase Justine & Caroline's {{A}} <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $7 for $8 turns.": "",
  "Punitive Mercy": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Selected Skill 1 and Two Masks as One by 3.": "",
  "Execution of Rebirth": "",
  "When Justine & Caroline activate their HIGHLIGHT, increase their ATK by $1, DMG Dealt by $2, and grant $3 of these effects to other allies for $4 turns.": "",
  "Humane Prison": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Selected Skill 2 and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Power to Resist {{A}}": "",
  "When this Awareness is unlocked, during battle, increase Wonder's skill and Thief Tactics levels by 1 (takes effect even when Justine & Caroline are not in battle). Also, increase [<link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>] by $1.\\nAt the start of battle, gain 1 [True Desire] stack. Afterwards, gain 1 [True Desire] stack every $2 turns.\\nAt the start of Justine & Caroline's turn, they can spend 1 [True Desire] stack to enhance the next activated [Two Masks as One].\\nEnhanced effect: Activate all [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] effects for [Two Masks as One]. Also, deal bonus damage to the main target equal to $4 of ATK ($3 hits. Increase this skill's effect by 1% for every 1 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>. These bonus attacks deal 1 hit of Fire, Ice, Elec, Wind, Psy, Nuke, Bless, and Curse damage each.)": "",
  "Blazing Strike": "",
  "Sunder Strike": "",
  "Hero Focus": "",
  "Heck 'n Blast": "",
  "Power Swing": "",
  "Serious": "",
  "High-Spirited": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nDetonate the target's [Fever Pitch] and deal bonus Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Junpei's Max HP. Also decrease all foes' DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> bonus DEF Down at <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> Max HP) and increase party's Fire DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> bonus Fire damage dealt at <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> Max HP). Lasts for $9 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>A blazing fireball is fiercely shot at the enemy, suddenly erupting into dazzling flames, delivering scorching destruction and dealing Fire damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nDetonate the target's [Fever Pitch] and make this damage <link\\=\"s|220\"><u>[Guaranteed Critical]</u></link>. Also decrease target's DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus DEF Down at <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP) and increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> bonus DMG Dealt at <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Pouring every ounce of his strength into the sharpened blade, that unstoppable brute force smashes into the foe's body, dealing Phys damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Junpei gains [Center Stage] and taunts all foes for $1 turns.\\nIncrease party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Junpei's max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP) and increase Fire Assassins or Sweepers' Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> more (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns.\\n[Center Stage]: Junpei takes $9 damage for all allies, only take a certain percentage of damage when taking non Damage Over Time damage (when taking damage for <color\\=#FFFC40>1/2/3/4</color> times, the damage multiplier is $10/$11/$12/$13 respectively). Junpei gains Null Down and Null Mental Ailments. When taking non Damage Over Time damage, <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> base chance to inflict the attacker with Burn. If Junpei didn't take non Damage Over Time damage for 1 turn and has Charge, activate [Power Swing].\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The heavy greatsword seems to lose its weight in his hands; the clamor of the battlefield stills for him. This fierce will in the name of \"heroism\" also ignites a murderous intent in his companions' eyes, sharp enough to tear through anything.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Heck 'n Blast: Use condition: When Junpei has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Junpei's Max HP. Ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $3, after knocking down the target, spread the Down Points damage left to other foes.\\nGrant the party [Fired Up]: Increase ATK (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> ATK at <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> Max HP) and Crit DMG (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> Crit DMG at <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns. Stacks up to $9 times. \\nAt the start of battle, if there is a Fire Assassin or Sweeper on the field, double Junpei's base Theurgy.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Grant party a Shield equal to $10 of Junpei's Max HP. Lasts for $11 turns.": "",
  "When {{A}} is present, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. At the start of battle, if there is a Fire Assassin or Sweeper on the field, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>.": "",
  "When {{A}} is present, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. At the start of battle, if there is a Fire Assassin or Sweeper on the field, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>.": "",
  "At the end of Junpei's turn, restore Junpei's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nAfter any ally is below <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> Max HP, restore party's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of Junpei's max HP. Recharge this effect when using [Hero Focus].": "",
  "At the end of Junpei's turn, restore Junpei's HP by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nAfter any ally is below <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> Max HP, restore party's HP by <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color> of Junpei's max HP. Recharge this effect when using [Hero Focus].": "",
  "Wannabe Hero": "",
  "At the end of any ally's turn, Junpei gains $1 [Competitive Heart] stack. Stacks up to $2 times.\\nWhen [Competitive Heart] reaches $3 stacks, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> and Fire DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>.\\nWhen [Competitive Heart] reaches $6 stacks, increase Junpei's DMG RES by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color>, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> and Fire DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color>.\\nJunpei gains $11 Charge stack every $10 turns, when taking non Damage Over Time damage, use [Power Swing] on the attacker then gain $12 [Competitive Heart] stacks. \\n[Power Swing]: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> of Junpei's Max HP, this has <link\\=\"s|220\"><u>[Guaranteed Critical]</u></link>. Also inflict all foes with [Fever Pitch], and grant the party a Shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> of Junpei's Max HP for $15 turns. When using [Blazing Strike]/[Sunder Strike] to attack foes with [Fever Pitch], activate bonus effects. When a foe is defeated, pass its [Fever Pitch] stack onto the highest HP foe. [Power Swing] counts as a Follow Up.": "",
  "Mood Maker": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain $1 [Competitive Heart] stacks. Increase the maximum number of [Competitive Heart] stacks to $2.\\nWhen [Competitive Heart] reaches $3 stacks, increase party's Crit DMG by $4, increase Fire Assassins or Sweepers' Crit DMG by $5 more.\\nWhen [Competitive Heart] reaches $6 stacks, increase party's ATK by $7, increase Fire Assassins or Sweepers' ATK by $8 more.": "",
  "End of Inferiority": "",
  "When activating [Power Swing], permanently increase party's DMG Dealt by $1. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "Energetic Partner": "",
  "Weight of Life": "",
  "When using Theurgy, fully restore user's HP.": "",
  "On My Life!": "",
  "Unknown Possibilities": "",
  "When gaining $1 [Competitive Heart] stacks, Junpei can upgrade his Melee Attack to [Power Swing], after using this [Power Swing], Junpei can use other skills.\\nThis [Power Swing] will inflict all foes with [Fever Pitch] or upgrade [Fever Pitch] to [Fever Pitch: Improved], when using [Blazing Strike]/[Sunder Strike], if there is a foe with [Fever Pitch: Improved], increase all foes' Downed DMG Taken by $2 and Fire DMG Taken by $3. Also increase Fire Assassins or Sweepers' Downed DMG by $4. Lasts for $5 turn. \\nAt the start of battle, double Junpei's base Theurgy Energy recovery.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Ice damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $5 for $7 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Mischief & Innocence].": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK and Ice damage equal to $2 of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of Desire Level). \\nAlso, increase party's ATK by $6 X Desire Level points / $5 for $7 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Mischief & Innocence].": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Wind damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, decrease party's DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 more for $8 turns. \\nAlso, restore party's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of {{A}} & {{B}}'s ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color>. \\nGain [Facade of Service & Admonition].": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK and Wind damage equal to $2 of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of Desire Level). \\nAlso, decrease <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> DMG Taken by $5 + $7 X Desire Level points / $6 more for $8 turns. \\nAlso, restore <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> HP by $9 of {{A}} & {{B}}'s ATK + $10. \\nGain [Facade of Service & Admonition].": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Nuke damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>).\\nAlso, increase Pierce for Justine & Caroline and the Sweeper/Assassin ally with the highest ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 more for $8 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense].": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK and Nuke damage equal to $2of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of Desire Level).\\nAlso, increase Pierce for Justine & Caroline and the Sweeper/Assassin ally with the highest ATK by $5 + $7 X Desire Level points / $6 more for $8 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense].": "",
  "Deal Bless damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Curse damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>).\\nAlso, increase Justine & Caroline's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 more; DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $9 more; and Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $12 more for $14 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Luck & Loss].": "",
  "Deal Bless damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK and Curse damage equal to $2 of ATK (1 hit each; increase this effect by $4 for every $3 point of Desire Level).\\nAlso, increase Justine & Caroline's ATK by $5+ $7 X Desire Level points / $6 more; DMG Dealt by $8 + $10 X Desire Level points / $9 more; and Crit Rate by $11 + $13 X Desire Level points / $12 more for $14 turns.\\nGain [Facade of Luck & Loss].": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). Also, spend all [Facades] to activate the following effects based on their combination.\\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence] + [Facade of Service & Admonition]: Restore party's HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Also, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 for $8 turns.\\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence] + [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Grant other allies <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of [<link\\=\"s|272\"><u>Skill Effect Amp</u></link>] for $12 turns. Also, increase other allies' Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $10. \\nSkill Effect Amp: Increase the values of {{A}} skills and Thief Tactics that are increased when leveled up. This effect is calculated separately from other effects.\\n[Facade of Mischief & Innocence] + [Facade of Luck & Loss]: Change this skill's target to all foes.\\n[Facade of Service & Admonition] + [Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense]: Grant all allies a Shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$13</color> of Justine & Caroline's ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> and 1 Down Point for $17 turns. Also, increase party's DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$16</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $15.\\n[Facade of Service & Admonition] + [Facade of Luck & Loss]: $18 base chance to inflict Shock, Windswept and $19 Curse stacks on the main target, and gain $20 Blessing stacks. These effects last for $21 turns. Also, decrease all foes' DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$22</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$24</color> X Desire Level points / $23 for $25 turns.\\n[Facade of Absurdity & Nonsense] + [Facade of Luck & Loss]: This skill deals 1 more hit of Almighty damage. Also, gain [Rebel Surveillance] for $26 turns.\\nRebel Surveillance: When using skills, temporarily gain <color\\=#FFFC40>$27</color> of <link\\=\"s|274\"><u>Effects Stats</u></link> from the Assassin/Sweeper ally with the highest ATK (excluding Justine & Caroline).": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). Also, spend all [Facades] to restore party's HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Also, increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> X <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link> points / $6 for $8 turns.": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [Facade] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of Desire Level). Also, spend <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> [Facades] to restore <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> HP equal to $4 of ATK + $5. Also, increase <color\\=#FFFF00>party's</color> DMG Dealt by $7 X Desire Level points / $6 for $8 turns.": "",
