  "Usable when any 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, spend all [Facades] to inflict Shock, Windswept and $5 Curse stacks on the main target ($4 base chance), and gain $6 Blessing stacks. These effects last for $7 turns. Also, decrease all foes' DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color> X Desire Level points / $9 for $11 turns.": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [Facade] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of Desire Level). \\nAlso, spend <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> [Facades] to inflict Shock, Windswept and $5 Curse stacks on the main target ($4 base chance), and gain $6 Blessing stacks. These effects last for $7 turns. Also, decrease <color\\=#FFFF00>all</color> foes' DEF by $8 + $10 X Desire Level points / $9 for $11 turns.": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, spend all [Facades] to deal 1 more hit of Almighty damage. Also, gain [Rebel Surveillance] for $4 turns.\\nRebel Surveillance: When using skills, temporarily gain <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> of <link\\=\"s|274\"><u>Effects Stats</u></link> from the Assassin/Sweeper ally with the highest ATK.": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [Facade] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of Desire Level). \\nAlso, spend all [Facades] to deal 1 more hit of Almighty damage. Also, gain [Rebel Surveillance] for $4 turns.\\n[Rebel Surveillance]: When using skills, temporarily gain $5 of Effects Stats from the Assassin/Sweeper ally with the highest ATK.": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>). \\nAlso, spend all [<link\\=\"s|273\"><u>Facade</u></link>] to deal bonus damage to the main target equal to $5 of ATK ($4 hits. Increase this skill's effect by $7 for every $6 point of <link\\=\"s|271\"><u>Desire Level</u></link>. These bonus attacks deal 1 hit of Fire, Ice, Electric, Wind, Psy, Nuke, Bless, and Curse damage each.).\\nActivate all [Two Masks as One] abilities.": "",
  "Usable when any 2 types of [Facade] have been gained.\\nDeal Almighty damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of ATK (increase this effect by $3 for every $2 point of Desire Level). \\nAlso, spend all [Facades] to deal bonus damage to the main target equal to $5 of ATK ($4 hits. Increase this skill's effect by $7 for every $6 point of Desire Level. These bonus attacks deal 1 hit of Fire, Ice, Electric, Wind, Psy, Nuke, Bless, and Curse damage each.).\\nActivate all [Two Masks as One] abilities.": "",
