  "T<color\\=#000000>r</color>ue Desire": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nDetonate the target's [Fever Pitch] and deal bonus Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Junpei's Max HP. Also decrease all foes' DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> bonus DEF Down at <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> Max HP) and increase party's Fire DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> bonus Fire damage dealt at <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> Max HP). Lasts for $9 turns.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $1 of Junpei's Max HP.\\nDetonate the target's [Fever Pitch] and deal bonus Fire damage to all foes equal to $2 of Junpei's Max HP. Also decrease all foes' DEF by $3 (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $5 bonus DEF Down at $4 Max HP) and increase party's Fire DMG Dealt by $6 (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $8 bonus Fire DMG Dealt at $7 Max HP). Lasts for $9 turns.": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nDetonate the target's [Fever Pitch] and make this damage <link\\=\"s|220\"><u>[Guaranteed Critical]</u></link>. Also decrease target's DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus DEF Down at <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP) and increase party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> bonus DMG Dealt at <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns.": "",
  "Deal Phys damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Junpei's Max HP.\\nDetonate the target's [Fever Pitch] and make this damage [Guaranteed Critical]. Also decrease target's DEF by 2 (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $4 bonus DEF Down at $3 Max HP) and increase party's DMG Dealt by $5 (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $7 bonus DMG Dealt at $6 Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns.": "",
  "Junpei gains [Center Stage] and taunts all foes for $1 turns.\\nIncrease party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Junpei's max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP) and increase Fire Assassins or Sweepers' Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> more (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns.\\n[Center Stage]: Junpei takes $9 damage for all allies, only take a certain percentage of damage when taking non Damage Over Time damage (when taking damage for <color\\=#FFFC40>1/2/3/4</color> times, the damage multiplier is $10/$11/$12/$13 respectively). Junpei gains Null Down and Null Mental Ailments. When taking non Damage Over Time damage, <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> base chance to inflict the attacker with Burn. If Junpei didn't take non Damage Over Time damage for 1 turn and has Charge, activate [Power Swing].": "",
  "Junpei gains [Center Stage] and taunts all foes for $1 turns.\\nIncrease party's Crit DMG by $2 (based on Junpei's max HP, up to $4 bonus Crit DMG at $3 Max HP) and increase Fire Assassins or Sweepers' Crit DMG by $5 more (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $7 bonus Crit DMG at $6 Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns.\\n[Center Stage]: Junpei takes $9 damage for all allies, only take a certain percentage of damage when taking non Damage Over Time damage (when taking damage for 1/2/3/4 times, the damage multiplier is $10/$11/$12/$13 respectively). Junpei gains Null Down and Null Mental Ailments. When taking non Damage Over Time damage, $14 chance to inflict the attacker with Burn. If Junpei didn't take non Damage Over Time damage for 1 turn and has Charge, activate [Power Swing].": "",
  "Use condition: When Junpei has $1 Theurgy Energy.\\nDeal Phys damage to <color\\=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $2 of Junpei's Max HP. Ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $3, after knocking down the target, spread the Down Points damage left to other foes.\\nGrant the party [Fired Up]: Increase ATK (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $5 ATK at $4 Max HP) and Crit DMG (based on Junpei's Max HP, up to $7 Crit DMG at $6 Max HP). Lasts for $8 turns. Stacks up to $9 times. \\nAt the start of battle, if there is a Fire Assassin or Sweeper on the field, double Junpei's base Theurgy.": "",
  "Grant <color\\=#FFFF00>party</color> a Shield equal to $1 of Max HP. Lasts for $2 turns.": "",
